   "columns": [
    [
     {
      "type": "textmedia",
      "header": "",
      "body": "<h3>ZOLLER Automation Solutions does some things differently and many things better. They take the efficiency of tooling processes to the next level.</h3>",
      "images": [],
      "videos": [],
      "pos": "text",
      "cols": 1,
      "valign": "top",
      "ftype": "text",
      "id": "c2271",
      "bg": "",
      "space": {
       "before": "default",
       "after": "default"
      }
     }
    ],
    [
     {
      "type": "textmedia",
      "header": "",
      "body": "<p><strong>ZOLLER Automation Solutions automate all processes related to tools. From assistive robots on the presetting and measuring machines to the new »coraMeasure LG« gantry solution and full shop floor automation—including machine loading—anything is possible with ZOLLER. Build your smart factory step by step today. </strong></p> <p>Automation boosts profitability. It reduces the workload on skilled workers during tool assembly or when transporting tools to the CNC machine. It reduces costs, ensures tool availability, and increases productivity. </p> <p>With ZOLLER Automation Solutions, you can automate flexibly. All solutions are seamlessly integrated, and the entire production level—including all CNC machines—is taken into account. </p> <p><a class=\"btn\" href=\"/ca/products/automation\">Display Products</a></p>",
      "images": [],
      "videos": [],
      "pos": "text",
      "cols": 1,
      "valign": "top",
      "ftype": "text",
      "id": "c2270",
      "bg": "",
      "space": {
       "before": "default",
       "after": "default"
      }
     }
    ]
   ],
   "ftype": "container-2cols",
   "id": "c2272",
   "bg": "",
   "space": {
    "before": "extra-small",
    "after": "default"
   }
  },
  {
   "type": "quotes",
   "header": "",
   "slides": [
    {
     "img": {
      "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/8/5/csm_toolBalancer_Alexander_Zoller2_7bc76f629f.webp",
      "alt": ""
     },
     "text": "<p class=\"extra-large-text\">It is high time to modernize the way tools are provided in production processes. ZOLLER’s modular automation concept opens the door for every manufacturing facility to become a smart factory. </p> <p><strong>Alexander Zoller, Managing Director</strong></p>",
     "right": true,
     "quote": true,
     "dark": true
    },
    {
     "img": {
      "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/2/7/csm_toolBalancer_Christoph_Zoller2_490ea1f2a5.webp",
      "alt": ""
     },
     "text": "<p class=\"extra-large-text\">ZOLLER Automation Solutions are your logical next step. Boost the efficiency of your manufacturing with innovative technologies.</p> <p><strong>Christoph Zoller, Managing Director</strong></p>",
     "right": false,
     "quote": true,
     "dark": true
    }
   ],
   "ftype": "zoller_slider-full-width",
