    "after": "default"
   }
  },
  {
   "type": "textmedia",
   "header": "<h2> Automate with Tool Data </h2>",
   "body": "<p>Our sophisticated tool management system, with its many interfaces and functions, makes data-driven automation especially simple. With highly organized tool data in the ZOLLER z.One database and the ZOLLER-webTMS software, you can plan and manage the automated processes in your production environment—whether from your desktop or on the go.</p> <p>Learn more</p>",
   "images": [
    {
     "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/c/6/csm_software_automation_en_7ad0d9045a.webp",
     "alt": "",
     "w": 1454,
